The '''Super Cute Texture Pack'''<ref>{{Mcnet|super-cute-texture-pack-out-today|Super Cute Texture Pack out today|July 31, 2018|Tom Stone}}</ref> is a [[texture pack (downloadable content)|texture pack]] that customizes the game with colorful and cute textures. It additionally includes 15 skins.

